---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---

<ResearchLayout
  title="AI Platform Evolution"
  page="P3"
  signal="AI Platform"
  evidence="Four Signals"
  focus="Compute → Packaging → Optical → Infrastructure"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P3</div>
      <h1>四個訊號如何共同打造下一代 AI 平台</h1>
      <p>技術不是單點突破，而是多個領域同步進化、相互支撐，最終形成一個更強大的 AI Platform。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">FOUR SIGNALS</div>
        <h2>四個訊號</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">01 · COMPUTE SCALING</span>
        <h3>Compute Scaling</h3>
        <p>先進製程持續推進，AI/HPC 對運算密度與能源效率的需求同步提高。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">02 · ADVANCED PACKAGING</span>
        <h3>Advanced Packaging</h3>
        <p>CoWoS、SoIC、SoW 等 3DFabric 技術，將晶片、記憶體與系統整合推向更高密度。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">03 · OPTICAL INTERCONNECT</span>
        <h3>Optical Interconnect</h3>
        <p>當電互連的頻寬、距離與功耗成為限制，光互連成為下一階段 AI 系統的重要研究方向。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">04 · MATERIALS & INFRASTRUCTURE</div>
          <h2>Materials & Infrastructure</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <article class="card">
        <p>製程、封裝與互連升級，同時推動材料、設備、散熱與電力需求。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">RESEARCH CONCLUSION</div>
        <h2>No single technology builds a platform.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <article class="card">
      <p>Platforms emerge when technologies evolve together.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</ResearchLayout>
